From 2c5496da18fa6de8ee5bb6f9d0eaaf1a3bc2bfb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:22:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add wars, battles, sieges, peace deals, fronts and auto war
 plan

- WarManager: declare_war (allies join), daily battles between armies of enemies,
  sieges that change the province controller, war score, peace deals (white peace,
  take/give states), truces
- Army movement along land paths (Dijkstra), unit and group destruction
- Fronts along the border (auto generated or hand drawn) and an auto plan that
  assigns armies to fronts; AI countries at war use the same plan
- New game actions: move_army, stop_army, propose_peace, create_front,
  delete_front, toggle_front_province, set_front_mode, set_front_army,
  assign_free_armies, set_auto_plan
- declare_war / offer_peace diplomatic actions use the war manager
- Remove try/catch from execute_diplomatic_action (exceptions are disabled)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01THs9n9orfCNZXEMtU5goD6
Signed-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
